  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ArenaHintZone
  title: S4-A  CARRY + SPEED
  body: 'TAP left-click 3 times (one troop each). The label counts down 3, 2, 1,
    0 as troops arrive and turns blue at 0: the object then moves to the waypoint.
    Send more troops (max 6): the label goes -1, -2, -3 and it moves faster.

    EXPECT:
    delivered inside the ring (the waypoint''s capture zone), the label shows Placed,
    troops return. A cyan disc shows under the object while it is Active inside the
    ring.'
  radius: 3
