  body: 'Look at the enemy: no symbol. Press Z: number + health bar appear. Send
    troops one by one.

    EXPECT: number shows free slots (5 to 0, red at 0). Symbol
    hides again a few seconds after you clear the target and the troops leave.'
  radius: 3
--- !u!23 &1424660463
